 own digital forensics solution, OneFor(ensics), saving costs and reducing the time between alert and investigation.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/onemain-financial-logo%401x.9909bae073fded1168b974fb56065617dbd6c0fb.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"onemain financial","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-02-19","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/onemain-financial-aws-sfn-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"OneMain Financial","publishedDate":"2025","enableShare":"1","headline":"Speeding Up Security Forensics by 97.5% Using AWS Step Functions with OneMain Financial","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#step-functions","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Step Functions","description":"AWS Step Functions","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOB