e":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#brazil","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Brazil","description":"Brazil","dateCreated":"2020-04-20T18:05:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#step-functions","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Step Functions","description":"AWS Step Functions","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudtrail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudTrail","description":"AWS CloudTrail","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#gen-ai","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Gen AI","description":"\u003cp\u003eGenerative Artificial Intelligence\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-10T17:07:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-10T17:07:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#gen-ai","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Generative AI","description":"\u003cp\u003eGenerative AI\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-08-22T20:28:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-05-23T20:34:52+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#positivo-tecnologia-nextios-2024","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"positivo-tecnologia-nextios-2024","dateCreated":"2025-01-21T23:58:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T17:53:43+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eA Positivo Tecnologia, empresa brasileira fundada em 1989, destaca-se no setor educacional desenvolvendo solu\u0026ccedil;\u0026otilde;es tecnol\u0026oacute;gicas. Atrav\u0026eacute;s do Educacional \u0026ndash; Ecossistema de Tecnologia e Inova\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o, a Positivo oferece plataformas de aprendizagem, conte\u0026uacute;dos interativos e ferramentas de gest\u0026atilde;o escolar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eUm marco significativo foi a integra\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o do assistente de IA generativa, Maria, na plataforma Aprimora em 2023, aprimorando o suporte aos alunos. Em parceria com a Nextios e a AWS, a Positivo lan\u0026ccedil;ou o projeto Professor Digital, um assistente de IA generativa para apoiar professores, alunos e gestores com tarefas diversas, como resumos de aulas e elabora\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o de provas, integrado ao Hub Educacional.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eO projeto foi apresentado com sucesso na Bett Educar 2024, destacando uma arquitetura inovadora baseada em servi\u0026ccedil;os AWS, como Amazon Bedrock, AWS Lambda, e Amazon Transcribe. A solu\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o utiliza uma t\u0026eacute;cnica chamada prompt chain, proporcionando respostas r\u0026aacute;pidas e eficazes, criando uma experi\u0026ecirc;ncia fluida para os usu\u0026aacute;rios.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eA evolu\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o do Professor Digital inclui a integra\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o com edtechs e a capacidade de gerar conte\u0026uacute;dos automaticamente. A Positivo continua a explorar novas funcionalidades e a melhorar a ferramenta, visando implementar solu\u0026ccedil;\u0026otilde;es educacionais mais inteligentes e eficientes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eO objetivo futuro \u0026eacute; \u0026quot;produtizar\u0026quot; o Professor Digital, tornando-o amplamente dispon\u0026iacute;vel para escolas, e continuar a agregar valor atrav\u0026eacute;s da IA generativa, facilitando a gest\u0026atilde;o educacional e melhorando a experi\u0026ecirc;ncia de aprendizado.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Positivo%20Logo%20200x70px.2eb66ce02db761f3af431d17d9a5572e31a8e4fa.png","footerInfoText":"2024","industry":"Retail","sortDate":"2024-07-02","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/partners/success/positivo-tecnologia-nextios/","publishedDate":"2024","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Com IA AWS, Nextios desenvolve Professor Digital para a Positivo Tecnologia"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#step-functions","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Step Functions","description":"AWS Step Functions","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#bedrock-knowledge-bases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Bedrock Knowledge Bases","description":"Bedrock Knowledge Bases","dateCreated":"2023-12-28T17:13:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-01-05T17:36:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#brazil","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Brazil","description":"Brazil","dateCreated":"2020-04-20T18:05:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#retail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Retail","description":"Retail","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#opensearch-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon OpenSearch Service (OSS)","description":"Amazon OpenSearch Service (OSS)","dateCreated":"2022-07-14T21:40:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-07-22T00:15:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#bedrock","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Bedrock","description":"Amazon Bedrock","dateCreated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#tp-icap","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"tp-icap","dateCreated":"2024-12-16T17:36:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-01-23T22:00:28+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Liquidity and data solutions specialist TP ICAP is trusted by clients worldwide for its market intelligence, data and analytics, and broking services. The company has moved 50 percent of its IT estate to Amazon Web Services, giving it the scale and security to run critical financial trading platforms as well as accelerating decarbonization and supporting its commitment to sustainability. By using the latest generative artificial intelligence solutions such as Amazon Bedrock, TP ICAP’s Parameta Solutions is transforming how its teams put new ideas into action.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/tp-icap-logo%401x.e13716c27de215c38fc82082a98139a3b8d58a75.jpg","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/tp-icap-logo%401x.e13716c27de215c38fc82082a98139a3b8d58a75.jpg","displayLo