Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#lifeomic-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"lifeomic-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-07-26T21:37:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:17+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Software company LifeOmic built a serverless architecture on AWS, achieving 30–50 percent cost savings and faster time to market as it launched its healthcare data solution, Precision Health Cloud.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/lifeomic-logo%401x.ebd1ad9fca4a0cc82f9c5c9117bbe496ae5f7f07.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"lifeomic","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2022-07-26","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/lifeomic-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"LifeOmic","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"LifeOmic Achieves up to 50% Cost Savings after Building Serverless Architecture on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated